          <attvalue for="36" value="A concentration of transit control (e.g., unilateral command or sustained overseas tasking) requires prolonged redeployment of U.S. and partner military assets and signals unilateral crisis management, which undermines trust and coordinated burden‑sharing among East Asian security partners." />
