          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A move toward concentrated transit control (e.g., tighter state enforcement in Hormuz) elicits focused defensive deployments and prioritization of limited counter‑drone systems to the Gulf, reducing the proportion of critical nodes covered in the Russia‑Ukraine zone." />
