          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in systemic airspace safety incidents tied to the Russia–Ukraine conflict forces major powers to reallocate military assets, intelligence and diplomatic bandwidth to European air defense and escalation management, lowering the depth and immediacy of their engagement in the Israel–Gaza–Lebanon crisis." />
