          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in high‑visibility airspace safety incidents linked to the Ukraine conflict prompts faster multilateral civil‑military coordination and information‑sharing norms among concerned states, which regional actors in Northeast Asia adopt to mitigate similar risks, thereby increasing alliance coordination and cohesion." />
